1. Reign-era table (年号表)

   Location: `crates/studio-analysis/src/calendar.rs`, `const ERAS`.

   A transcription of the publicly maintained 中国年号列表, licensed CC BY-SA 4.0 and
   following 李崇智《中国历代年号考》: every era name the source dates in the Common Era,
   from 新莽 to 民国 — about 700 era names in roughly a thousand rows, because several
   names were used by more than one reign.

   The individual facts recorded here — an era name and the years it ran — are
   not themselves copyrightable. The selection and arrangement of the table were
   adapted from a CC BY-SA 4.0 source, so that table is offered under CC BY-SA
   4.0 and is not relicensed under the Apache License 2.0. Anyone redistributing
   or adapting it must credit the source and share adaptations under the same
   license:

     https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%B9%B4%E5%8F%B7%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8
     https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%94%90%E6%9C%9D%E5%B9%B4%E8%99%9F%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8

   The names recorded there are also cited in the report and in the Timeline
   panel's boundary note, so the credit reaches a reader of the analysis, not
   only a reader of the source.

